-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Weeks</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Patient satisfaction after anaesthesia and surgery: results of a prospective survey of 10,811 patients</article-title><source>Br J Anaesth</source><year>2000</year><volume>84</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>6</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10740539</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b6-tcrm-5-0021"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gan</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk factors for postoperative nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Anesth Analg</source><year>2006</year><volume>102</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>1884</fpage><lpage>98</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16717343</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b7-tcrm-5-0021"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Duncan</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name><name><surname>DeBoer</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>Tweed</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The postoperative interview: assessing risk factors for nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Anesth Analg</source><year>1994</year><volume>78</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8267183</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8-tcrm-5-0021"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lerman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Surgical and patient factors involved in postoperative nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Br J Anaesth</source><year>1992</year><volume>69</volume><issue>7 Suppl 1</issue><fpage>24S</fpage><lpage>32S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1486011</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9-tcrm-5-0021"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Apfel</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Laara</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Koivuranta</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Greim</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Roewer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A simplified risk score for predicting postoperative nausea and vomiting: conclusions from cross-validations between two centers</article-title><source>Anesthesiology</source><year>1999</year><volume>91</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>693</fpage><lpage>700</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10485781</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10-tcrm-5-0021"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Paech</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pavy</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Single-dose prophylaxis for postoperative nausea and vomiting after major abdominal surgery: ondansetron versus droperidol</article-title><source>Anaesth Intensive Care</source><year>1995</year><volume>23</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>548</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8787252</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11-tcrm-5-0021"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Apfel</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Greim</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Haubitz</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Goepfert</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Usadel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sefrin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A risk score to predict the probability of postoperative vomiting in adults</article-title><source>Acta Anaesthesiol Scand</source><year>1998</year><volume>42</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>495</fpage><lpage>501</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9605363</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b12-tcrm-5-0021"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Apfel</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kranke</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Eberhart</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Roewer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of predictive models for postoperative nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Br J Anaesth</source><year>2000</year><volume>88</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>234</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11883387</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b13-tcrm-5-0021"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Apfel</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kranke</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Greim</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Roewer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>What can be expected from risk scores for predicting postoperative nausea and vomiting?</article-title><source>Br J Anaesth</source><year>2001</year><volume>86</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>822</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11573590</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14-tcrm-5-0021"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Biedler</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wermelt</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kunitz</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilhelm</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Dethling</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A risk adapted approach reduces the overall institutional incidence of postoperative nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Can J Anaesth</source><year>2004</year><volume>51</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14709454</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15-tcrm-5-0021"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stadler</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bardiau</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Seidel</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Albert</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Boogaerts</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Difference in risk factors for postoperative nausea and vomiting</article-title><source>Anesthesiology</source><year>2003</year><volume>98</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>46</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12502978</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b16-tcrm-5-0021"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sinclair</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Chung</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Mezei</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Can postoperative nausea and vomiting be predicted</article-title><source>Anesthesiology</source><year>1999</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>109</fpage><lpage>118</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10422935</pub-id></citati